      "title": {
        "en": "Patient and dedicated personal trainers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise trainers Wilberg and Michelle for their deep understanding of canine behavior and genuine dedication. Owners note that the instructors create a calm atmosphere, adapt techniques to each dog, and provide thorough guidance so families can continue reinforcing lessons effectively at home."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affectionate care and safe handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize that pets receive attentive, family-like care during both boarding stays and training courses. Dog parents frequently highlight the gentle handling of nervous or reactive dogs, observing that their pets arrive excited, play happily in secure spaces, and return home relaxed without showing signs of stress."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Remarkable progress in canine obedience"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners report significant behavioral improvements, particularly with pulling on leashes, reactivity toward other dogs, and basic house manners. Many clients mention that stubborn or fearful dogs become obedient and manageable on walks after several weeks of focused instruction and structured socialization."
      }
    }
  ],
